hared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757670/extras/195df9661ebbd4b29f43a76b6d99e296.poster.avif?t=1755206323\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757670/extras/195df9661ebbd4b29f43a76b6d99e296.webm?t=1755206323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757670/extras/195df9661ebbd4b29f43a76b6d99e296.mp4?t=1755206323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757670/extras/78344b8293bf8501d1ab785292f7c417.avif?t=1755206323\" data-has-big width=800 height=67 /></span>NODE rewards those who look closer. Beyond its surface lies a network of hidden challenges, secret paths, and layered narratives waiting to be uncovered by those who question the obvious. Every detour offers deeper insight into the world\u2019s history and architecture, inviting puzzle-solvers to dig beneath the noise and discover what others overlook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757670/extras/f14fc7acb98a03292e999b9773b64aae.poster.avif?t=1755206323\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757670/extras/f14fc7acb98a03292e999b9773b64aae.webm?t=1755206323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757670/extras/f14fc7acb98a03292e999b9773b64aae.mp4?t=1755206323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
